<title>SPAIN: FCC H1 pretax profit 13.81 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>FCC H1 pretax profit 13.81 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June results for construction group FCC in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Turnover				202.090    down  3.3 pct</p>
<p> Pretax profit			  13.805    vs   14.779</p>
<p> Attributable profit		   6.404   vs   n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas S.A. The firm said 55.8 percent of turnover corresponds to building activity, with diversified activities accounting for the remainder.</p>
<p>Sales margin stood at 3.2 percent of attributable profit, unchanged from the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>FCC's order book stood at 340 billion pesetas, up 16 percent from end-1995.</p>
<p>FCC said foreign business activities had &quot;increased strongly&quot; in the period.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
